WEBVTT

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.680
Hey, hey...

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.000
Come on!  Wake up!

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.010
Shunka-sama!

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:47.830
Tome-san?

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:51.980
Thank heavens, you've regained consciousness!

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:54.870
Where am I?  What happened to me?

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:57.860
We're not really sure.

00:01:58.290 --> 00:01:59.840
But that white-haired person...

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:01.550
White-haired?

00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:07.640
So they were using a natural cave as an underground facility?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.150
Interesting.  An ideal place to hide.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:13.180
Ah-ah.  Akechi?

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:15.160
No, Twenty Faces?

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:19.010
So Twenty Faces did disguise himself as me after all.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:22.090
And now he's left.

00:02:22.090 --> 00:02:24.140
He's probably after that white-haired demon...

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.250
No, he's following Mikamo Chizuko-kun.

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.250
The young lady.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.670
For the present, let's get out of here.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.750
Damn it!  Why is this thing so slow?!

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.940
Just answer me this:

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:46.710
Why did you abandon us?

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.650
Don't just smile, answer me!

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.920
Our group was supposed to be a family.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:57.880
Forgive me for not saying anything to you.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:03.820
I finally realized that the war wasn't over yet.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:06.780
I need to bring that to an end first.

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:08.090
What do you mean by–

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:08.910
Ken.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.910
We can see it now.  Over there.

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.400
What's that?

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.310
Isn't it beautiful?

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:30.520
That's going to be the place where you die.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:41.370
We're about to depart!  Anyone boarding, please make your way on board.

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:45.670
Let's go, Ken.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:46.450
OK.

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.270
He's followed us here.

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:54.900
That man who should have given up hoping for anything.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.380
And all for one little girl.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:01.400
It takes me back.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.910
I haven't seen his eyes like that in a long time.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.890
So you're...

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:06.970
...in love with him?

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.310
I'm...

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:12.370
...a monster.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:19.000
I hate you.  He betrayed me and went to you!

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:30.490
It'd be a shame to let you die here.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:34.250
I'll kill you right in front of his eyes.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.000
The car is parked close by.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:57.160
First, let's return to the mansion and call the police.

00:04:57.160 --> 00:04:59.150
Look, it's an airship.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:02.330
What's that?

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:04.330
Oh, that's one of those...  You know.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.510
What do they call it again?  Pro...  Pro...

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:09.580
Promotion.  They're advertising for a movie.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.430
A movie?

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:12.950
Yeah, that "Eternal Love" movie.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.720
"Eternal Love"?

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:18.960
Oh, is that the movie where the producer was murdered?

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.510
What is it?

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:24.750
We were on the island the day that murder happened.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:29.470
All of a sudden, the young lady said she wanted to go see a film set.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:35.800
Akine-san.

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:39.580
My apologies, but do you think you can take these two in a taxi?

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:42.000
Huh?  I don't mind, but what will you do?

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.960
I'm going after that airship.  Excuse me.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:45.880
Hey!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.530
Chizuko-kun is probably on board.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:06:00.690
As you are all aware, we suffered a tragedy on our way to this occasion.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:06.420
However, the remaining staff have worked their hardest to honor the legacy of the victim.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:11.550
We worked together as one and managed to complete the film in the end.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:16.380
I can't find Chiko and that white-haired bitch.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.210
So, please join me in raising your glasses...

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:21.360
...along with your fellow coworkers.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.490
Here you are.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:28.940
To the success of the film and for everyone's advancement:

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:31.340
Cheers!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.180
There's something in it!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.360
She couldn't have...

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:12.830
Traveling is more fun with a little excitement.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.750
You bitch!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.780
They should all be dead by now.

00:07:19.020 --> 00:07:20.570
How far have you...

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:22.270
Have I become a monster?

00:07:23.140 --> 00:07:25.290
Why don't I let you confirm that for yourself?

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:27.840
Wait!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.020
I'll go after her.

00:07:31.020 --> 00:07:33.320
There's another job I need you to do.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.160
Come right in.  I'll make you welcome.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:56.470
Now then, your beloved Mikamo Chizuko-kun is very close by.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:08:00.730
Your puppet who subconsciously thinks just like you.

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:05.480
What do you see in her?

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:08.640
I'm not going to answer you.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:09.980
Give me the girl.

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.270
I'm shocked.

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:17.360
Just what do you think you can do to me with that thing?

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.790
Let's cut the useless chit-chat.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:23.210
Is she that important to you?

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:27.860
What could someone like you who has despaired for this world be hoping for at this late hour?

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:32.860
The difference between me and you is that I have a child who will continue on into the future.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:37.780
And?  What if you lost that child?

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:55.670
You chose me after all.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.310
What kind of despicable trick is this?

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:58.590
Where is she?

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:01.240
She's up in the sky, just like us.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:18.110
Ah, oh no!

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:42.970
<i>This</i> is my job?

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.750
If I move it, it might explode.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:49.920
I guess I'll have to defuse it here.

00:10:04.760 --> 00:10:06.360
Is this some kind of joke?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.830
Everyone in your life...

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:17.010
...will die.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:19.510
Mister...

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:27.230
Let's return to those days.

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.230
Let's exit this world...

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:32.900
...together.

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:35.920
I refuse!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:52.210
What do you think of this body of mine?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.130
I can fight on equal ground with you now.

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:57.130
It was the fruit of our research.

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.360
You praised it too.

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:14.690
An artificial body designed to strengthen and repair bodily injuries.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:16.440
That's quite fascinating.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:20.250
Thank you.

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:22.810
I wonder if you wouldn't mind giving me a tour tomorrow.

00:11:24.770 --> 00:11:26.730
I've heard about you.

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.350
The young, world-class, genius scientist.

00:11:29.350 --> 00:11:32.630
And even the professors respect you for that.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.770
I've heard that you've been in contact with the military.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.810
Does that have something to do with the war that's about to start?

00:11:42.050 --> 00:11:44.560
You're wearing lipstick today, eh?

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.090
It looks good on you.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:51.090
You notice the frivolous things.

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:52.370
That's a change of pace around here.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.340
It's too hard to control to be practical.

00:12:02.340 --> 00:12:04.930
We can't make it like a human hand.

00:12:04.930 --> 00:12:08.560
It's not likely that anyone except me will be able to operate this artificial hand.

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:09.620
No one except you?

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.540
Internal body electricity?

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:19.850
They used to call me demon child when I was a kid.

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:21.530
Everyone thought I was creepy.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:25.690
So?  I'm a tiny bit of a monster, aren't I?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:31.020
Your eyes are just like your lips.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.770
In my eyes, they're all glowing with the same light.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.350
Why did you choose her and not me?

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:46.220
You're mistaken.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:48.990
She was the one who chose me.

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.790
I don't believe you!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.520
Calm down.

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:01.130
You can do this.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.280
No matter how dangerous it is, never give up.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.450
OK, Skipper.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:10.360
Always keep your joints loose.

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:12.930
It'll come in handy someday.

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:18.430
If you're tied up, don't try to fight the rope.

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.570
Relax your body and slip your fingers out one at a time.

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.910
What you lack in strength, you make up for in agility.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:30.280
Turn your weakness into a strength.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:48.730
Look at me...

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:49.660
...and me alone.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.450
It was all for this day.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.800
To see what you see with my own eyes.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:59.130
And how many did you kill for the sake of this?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:05.720
I don't let anyone get in my way.

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:15.430
How did you...

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:19.200
I'm the daughter of Twenty Faces.

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:22.920
Mister...

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.460
Chiko, don't try to do too much.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:33.010
I've finally found you!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:42.000
A radiant gemstone?

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:44.510
It's been passed on for generations.

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:45.620
There are two of them.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:51.550
I'm giving one to you.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:14:59.960
I don't understand myself.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:04.660
Every time I look in your eyes, it's like I'm being drawn in.

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:15.840
Mister!

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:17.410
Get down, Chiko.

00:15:23.920 --> 00:15:25.050
Mister!

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:28.900
You should have killed me back then.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:34.180
I didn't kill you because you were already dead.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:39.030
You're going to burn down the laboratory?

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:40.160
Why?

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:45.150
Our progress has all been in the wrong direction.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:49.120
Leave here before two days are over and forget all of this.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:52.820
If you stay behind, you'll be burned by the flames and die.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:57.270
This place never existed.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.430
Never existed?

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:05.010
Then, what about us?

00:16:05.010 --> 00:16:06.810
What about the first time we met?

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.730
I can't believe this.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.540
I've never seen such vitality before.

00:16:12.540 --> 00:16:16.840
This is too much!  I don't care how important the experiment is, this is going too far!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.350
Don't stop!

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.630
Complete it.

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.830
I'm the only one who can do it.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:28.960
I'm the one with the power.  He praised it himself.

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.640
It shines within me...  The light.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:06.490
Do you comprehend...

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:09.460
...the terror that I've been left with since then?

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:14.550
Someday this body may use up all my life energy.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.020
Do you know how long I've searched for you?!

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:23.310
But, your heart hasn't changed.

00:17:23.900 --> 00:17:25.800
You still...

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:26.710
...love him.

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:33.640
I wanted...

00:17:33.640 --> 00:17:35.430
...to be you.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.170
Stop.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.560
That's enough.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.620
This is our problem and ours alone.

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.190
My life belongs to you.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:48.670
I'll stay with you until the end this time.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.930
They make me happy, those words.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.980
I wish you said those to me back then.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.180
Your body...

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:05.340
Don't be sad.

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:10.640
It's operated well enough until now without adjustments.

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:16.280
I have what I've wanted to see this whole time right in front of me.

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:20.620
Let's go create that panorama you dreamed about together.

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.440
I'll never let go of you.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.960
'Til death do us part.

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:41.640
Shit!  I won't make it in time.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:44.370
We need to find parachutes and jump out of here.

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.270
I've got to tell Chiko and the Boss!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.810
It's a miracle she even lived this long.

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:55.820
It was her physical idiosyncrasy.

00:18:55.820 --> 00:18:57.770
And also her willpower.

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:00.280
She clung tenaciously to the grudge she had against me.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:05.290
Once she was confident that she had me, she died.

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:13.560
Hold on tight.

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:35.320
It's better this way.

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:38.320
I won't let anyone else set eyes on her.

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:43.860
She was searching for you, just like me.

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:44.740
Chiko.

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.150
Promise me.

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:49.380
Don't go anywhere.  No...

00:19:49.380 --> 00:19:51.350
Promise to take me along with you!

00:19:54.450 --> 00:19:57.050
I don't want to be alone again!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.250
Chiko.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.760
Boss!  Chiko!  This ship–

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:07.760
Mister?

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:12.440
A deep darkness is stirring somewhere in this world.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:16.100
That darkness and I need to finish things once and for all.

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:18.310
Then take me with you!

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:20.630
There are some things you're better off not knowing.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:22.760
They're exploding!

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:34.440
Mister!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.830
Take good care of Chiko, Ken!

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:46.640
Mister!

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.090
I'm alone.

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:55.650
All alone again.

00:20:59.770 --> 00:21:02.610
Oh, there you are.
